OL,3,ATrump waves green flag kicking off
OL,4,Ahigh-speed IndyCar race through
OL,5,AWashington
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump was among
OL,8,Fhundreds of people who gathered to see
OL,9,Fthe IndyCar race through the streets of
OL,10,FWashington DC on Sunday, marking the
OL,11,Fculmination of a series of summer
OL,12,Fevents to celebrate the country's 250th
OL,13,Fbirthday.
OL,15,FThe president and First Lady Melania
OL,16,FTrump took a ceremonial lap of the
OL,17,F1.7-mile track in his presidential
OL,18,Flimousine, The Beast.
OL,20,FAs they reached the finish line,
OL,21,FTrump's new Air Force One completed a
OL,22,Fflyover above the capital.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
